{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3d2d3be0-95c0-8792-b98d-ac091411b3c2",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T14:01:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Min-jun M. Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:57:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter Tavares. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. Can you hear me okay? I'm in my shop and the reception is kind of bad back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:58:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:58:09-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so I want to vote by mail, I think, in the next election. I'm the owner of a little shop, and I'm there basically all day, and with the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, I was in here Sunday digging out the front step, and it got me thinking I can't count on getting out on a given day. So how do I request a mail ballot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. You'd fill out a mail ballot application and return it to the Board of Canvassers or the state elections office. I can mail one to you, or you can print it from the state elections website. Are you registered at your current address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, registered, I've been at the same place about three years. Um, [line breaks up] sorry, did you say mail it to the board or the state?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either one works. Mail it, drop it off, or scan and send it in. Once it's processed, they send you the ballot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what ID is required? Like do I have to send a copy of my license or something with the application?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the application itself, you generally give your name, address, date of birth and signature. The ID question comes with the ballot. Rhode Island has the voter ID rules, and the instructions that come with the ballot tell you exactly what to include. I'd follow those closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So nothing special with the application, but the ballot has instructions. Sorry, you broke up on me right at [inaudible]. What was the last part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The instructions that come with the ballot explain what ID to include. Read them carefully before you send it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. That makes sense. Sorry, I'm all over the place today. My cousin's kid's school had a spirit day this morning, pajama day, and the kids came into my shop on the way in, a whole line of them in pajamas and slippers buying gum. Anyway, that's why my head's scattered. Where was I? The application. Can you just mail me one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to. I'll need a mailing address for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, it's the same as my voter address. Do I have to say it? I'd rather not say it over this line, it keeps cutting out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Since you're registered, I can look you up by name and date of birth and use the address on file. What's your full name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Min-jun M. Haddad. M-I-N, dash, J-U-N. Haddad, H-A-D-D-A-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Haddad. And your date of birth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so, it's [line breaks up] ninth, ninety-eight. March ninth, 1998."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "March ninth, 1998. I've found you. I'll send the application to the address on file. It should reach you in a few days. If it doesn't, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And if you need to reach me, it's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:01:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173. Got it. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:01:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:01:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
